{
  "version": 1,
  "authorization": "Owner approvals cmsg_01Gr5R4j3t2Yet65UcmhcVhADwvzg9kA9GinuWu3D7FSfe and cmsg_01Gr5R4j3t2Yet65UcmhcVhAAAbp6kqDfMqxzNm3PL6f5g (standing approval of English support copy for new classes), applied on 2026-11-11 to «El mundo en blanco» (ID 259): a new A0–C2 3D conversation and listening class in a paper world, whose A0 level is fully bilingual (encounters, answers, echoes and listening), whose A1 level glosses its key words in English, whose intro captions and interface hints carry an English line for beginners, plus one English line for the academies listing. This manifest approves only the exact English support literals listed below; it cannot exempt any edit or deletion of existing English copy.",
  "additions": [
    {
      "path": "app/academias/page.tsx",
      "text": "A paper world with no ink, in 3D: twelve origami beings, twelve deep questions, and colour returns with every answer."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "This world was made of paper and ink."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "One day, its people stopped telling their stories. And the ink dried up."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "You bring the last pencil."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "I keep it for myself"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "You fold the page in four and put it in your pocket. It weighs little and yet you feel it as you walk."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "I give it to someone"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "Senba takes it in her beak and flies off. She does not say who it is for: she says you already know."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "I leave it open and keep writing"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "The Page smiles. At the very bottom, with your pencil, someone has written a single phrase: “To be continued”."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "Follow the ink circles: someone is waiting beside each one."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "The whole world has colour. Go back to the great inkwell: your page is waiting."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "${who.name}'s ink is back. Look at the world."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/MundoGame.tsx",
      "text": "The page is yours. What do you do with it?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Crane number one thousand"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
