    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. I am Senba. I am crane number one thousand."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello, Senba. You are very white."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. A thousand cranes are one wish."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A wish is a lovely thing."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I wait and wait. You have a wish too."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What wish do you write on your crane?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "More time"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Time is a big wish."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "More calm"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I want calm too."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A trip"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "How nice! I do not travel: I wait."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What are you waiting for this week?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Who is waiting to hear from you?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Is your wish for you or for someone else?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the crane"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the wish"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "to wait"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "white"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "one thousand"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A boat on the sand"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There is a paper boat. It is not in the sea. It is on the sand."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. I am Captain Pliego."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. You are a boat with no sea."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I am made of paper. Water is bad for me."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "But the sea is lovely."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. The sea is adventure. The sand is calm."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Are you more sea or more sand?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Sea: I want adventure"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "How brave! I am afraid."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Sand: I want calm"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Like me. The sand is my home."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Both"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "One day sea and one day sand. That is fine."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What are you afraid of?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What small adventure do you want this month?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "In what place do you feel calm?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the boat"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the sea"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the sand"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "fear"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "adventure"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "The red mailbox"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There is a red mailbox. There is a fox with many letters. He is the postman."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Good morning. I am Remite, the postman."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. You have a lot of letters."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. They are letters with no stamp. Nobody sends them."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What a pity."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Here is a letter of yours. It has no name on it."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Who is your unstamped letter for?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "For someone in my family"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Family is always waiting for letters."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "For a friend"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A letter to a friend is a gift."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "For me"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Very good. You need letters too."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What three words are in your letter?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Who do you say “thank you” to today?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What lovely word do you rarely say?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the letter"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the mailbox"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the postman"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the stamp"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "to send"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A ball of paper"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There is a wastepaper bin. On the ground there is a ball of paper. It has two eyes."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. I am Borra. I am an idea."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. You are on the ground."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. To one person, I am a mistake."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A mistake is not a bad thing."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Thank you. You have mistakes too."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What do you do with a mistake of yours?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I start again"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Good! A new sheet."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I ask for help"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Two people see the mistake better."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I leave it and do something else"
