      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "again"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "The green frog"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There is a pond. There is a paper frog. It jumps and jumps."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello! I am Brinca. I jump."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello, Brinca. You jump very well."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Thank you. But I only jump forwards."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "You cannot go back."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "No. Behind me is yesterday. Ahead is tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What do you think about more: yesterday or tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yesterday"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yesterday is lovely. But I cannot go there."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Like me! Always forwards."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Today"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Today is a good place to be."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What good thing is there in your day today?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What nice plan do you have for tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What lovely moment from yesterday do you remember?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the frog"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "to jump"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "yesterday"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "forwards"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "The owl and the red pencil"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There is an owl with glasses. He has a red pencil. He is very serious."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Good afternoon. I am Don Margen."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. You have a red pencil."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. I see mistakes. Lots of mistakes."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "And not the good things."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hmm. That is true. I never say “well done”."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Which person often says “well done” to you?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "My family"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "You have a good family."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "My teacher"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A good teacher sees the good."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I do"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "How nice! I do not know how to do that."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Who do you say “well done” to?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "What do you do very well?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Are you demanding with other people?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the owl"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the pencil"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "the glasses"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "serious"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "demanding"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Five sisters"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "There are five paper dolls. They are sisters. They are the same."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. I am Lina. I am number three."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Hello. Your sisters are the same as you."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. One dress, one face, one hand."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "But you are Lina."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "Yes. I want to be a little different."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "How are you different from your family?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "In my job"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "A different job is a new road."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "In my tastes"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "I want a green dress. That is my taste."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/el-mundo-en-blanco/levels/a0.mjs",
      "text": "In my character"
