    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Senba, the crane, and Captain Pliego look at the sea."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hello. I am Senba. I am a crane."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hello. I am Pliego. I am a boat."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "The sea is very white today."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Yes. And the water is cold."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "I want to see the sun."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "I want a hot coffee."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What is Senba?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What colour is the sea?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "How is the water?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What does the boat want?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What colour is the sea in your country?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Do you want sun or rain for tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What do you drink on a cold morning?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "sea"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "water"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "sun"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Brinca, the frog, is jumping. Don Margen, the owl, is watching."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hello, Don Margen! I am jumping a lot today."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Good morning, Brinca. You jump badly."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "No! I jump very well. Look: one, two, three."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hmm. Three jumps. The third one is good."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Thank you! That is your first kind word."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "How many jumps does Brinca do?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Which jump is good?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "At first, how does Brinca jump according to the owl?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What does Brinca say at the end?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Do you jump, run or walk more?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Can you count to twenty in Spanish?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What sport is good for you?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "jump"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "third"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "kind, lovely"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Dardo, the plane, sees the city. Lina, the doll, is down below."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hello, Lina! From here I can see the whole city."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Hello, Dardo. Tell me what there is."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "There is a square, a market and a bridge."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "There are people in the square, for sure."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Yes. There is a party with music."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "How nice! I want to dance."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What does Dardo see?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What is there in the square?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What is there at the party?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What does Lina want?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What places are there near your home?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Who is the best dancer in your family?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What music is on your phone?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "square"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "market"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "It is night on the mountain. Candela, the lantern, talks to Mar, the whale."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Good evening, Mar. You are very high up."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Good evening, Candela. Your light is lovely."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Thank you. You are cold, I can see it."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "A little. The mountain is cold at night."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "I have fire. I am here with you."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Thank you, my friend. Now I am fine."
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What time of day is it?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What is Candela's light like?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Who is cold?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What does Candela have?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What do you do on a cold night?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "Who is with you on bad days?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "What do you see from a high mountain?"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "light"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "cold"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/escucha-3d/content/papel/a0.json",
      "text": "fire"
    }
  ]
}
